<!--StartFragment--><div class="art_photo photo_center" style="margin: 0px auto 32px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; clear: both; text-align: center; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: EllipsisFont, SUIT, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Helvetica-light, AppleSDGothicNeo-Light, Roboto-Light, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, Helvetica, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.16px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="art_photo_wrap" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: block; position: relative;"><p class="caption" style="margin: 12px auto 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 0.7778em; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5714; text-align: left; max-width: calc(100% - 20px); width: 700px;">허위사실공표 혐의를 받는 윤석열 전 대통령의 공직선거법 재판 2심 구형이 예정되었다 연기된 29일 서울 영등포구 국민의힘 당사의 모습. 2026.9.29 권도현 기자</p></div></div><div class="ad-txt-picbtm" style="margin: 0px 0px 32px; padding: 10px 20px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 84px; border-radius: 5px; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(248, 248, 248); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: EllipsisFont, SUIT, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Helvetica-light, AppleSDGothicNeo-Light, Roboto-Light, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, Helvetica, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.16px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="ad-wrapper" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; overflow: inherit; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><div class="ad-inner-wrap" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; background: none; z-index: 1; width: 552px;"><div id="articleImageTxtAd" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative;"><div id="innorameymW87b" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;"><ul class="innorame-slot" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none;"><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative;"><div class="title" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://io1.innorame.com/clk/ymW87b.B1W8YK" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener sponsored" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 0.85em; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: block; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 500;">병점역 10분대 ‘자이’ 줍줍... "1차 계약금 500만 원·청약통장X·실거주無"</a></div></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative;"><div class="title" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://io1.innorame.com/clk/ymW87b.LvXxlz" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener sponsored" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 0.85em; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: block; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 500;">로또, '5등'인 줄 알았는데 자세히 보니 '1등'이었다! 출근 중 '37억' 횡재한 사연</a></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><p class="content_text text-l" style="margin: 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; text-align: left !important; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: EllipsisFont, SUIT, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Helvetica-light, AppleSDGothicNeo-Light, Roboto-Light, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, Helvetica, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.16px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">윤석열 전 대통령의 공직선거법 위반 혐의 항소심 선고가 다음달 4일 생중계된다.</p><p class="content_text text-l" style="margin: 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; text-align: left !important; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: EllipsisFont, SUIT, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Helvetica-light, AppleSDGothicNeo-Light, Roboto-Light, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, Helvetica, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.16px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">서울고법 형사2-1부(재판장 백승엽)는 다음달 4일 오후 2시에 열리는 윤 전 대통령의 항소심 선고 공판을 생중계한다고 30일 밝혔다.</p><div class="banner-article-left type-pc" style="margin: 0px 32px 32px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; float: left; display: block; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: EllipsisFont, SUIT, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Helvetica-light, AppleSDGothicNeo-Light, Roboto-Light, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, Helvetica, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.16px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="ad-wrapper" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><div class="ad-inner-wrap" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; background: rgb(250, 250, 250); z-index: 1; width: 250px; height: 250px;"><div id="ads28" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative;"><iframe src="https://adv.khan.co.kr/RealMedia/ads/adstream_sx.ads/www.khan.co.kr/news@x17" width="250" height="250" frameborder="0" scrolling="no" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0" title="기사면 본문 배너1" hspace="0" vspace="0" data-gtm-yt-inspected-12="true" data-gtm-yt-inspected-55135588_83="true" data-gtm-yt-inspected-133708555_69="true" data-gtm-yt-inspected-23="true" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);"></iframe></div></div></div></div><p class="content_text text-l" style="margin: 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; text-align: left !important; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: EllipsisFont, SUIT, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Helvetica-light, AppleSDGothicNeo-Light, Roboto-Light, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, Helvetica, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.16px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">윤 전 대통령은 2022년 대통령 선거 과정에서 윤우진 전 용산세무서장에게 변호사를 소개한 사실이 없다고 말하고, ‘건진법사’ 전성배 씨를 김건희 여사와 함께 만난 적이 없다고 발언하는 등 허위사실을 공표한 혐의로 기소됐다.</p><p class="content_text text-l" style="margin: 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; text-align: left !important; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: EllipsisFont, SUIT, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Helvetica-light, AppleSDGothicNeo-Light, Roboto-Light, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, Helvetica, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.16px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">이에 대해 지난 7월 1심 재판부는 두 혐의를 모두 유죄로 인정해 징역 1년 6개월에 집행유예 3년을 선고했다. 공직선거법에 따라 윤 전 대통령에게 벌금 100만 원 이상의 형이 대법에서 최종 확정되면 당선이 무효가 되고, 국민의힘은 지난 대선에서 보전받은 선거비용 등 약 397억 원을 중앙선거관리위원회에 반환해야 한다.</p><p class="content_text text-l" style="margin: 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; text-align: left !important; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: EllipsisFont, SUIT, &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, Helvetica-light, AppleSDGothicNeo-Light, Roboto-Light, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, Helvetica, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.16px; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">김건희 여사 의혹을 수사한 민중기 특별검사팀(특검)은 지난 13일 열린 항소심 결심공판에서 1심과 같은 형을 유지해 달라고 요청했습니다. 반면 공직선거법 위반 혐의를 전면 부인하며 무죄를 주장했다. 윤 전 서장에게 변호사를 소개한 사실이 없고, 전씨 관련 발언도 당시 문답의 맥락을 왜곡해 허위사실 공표로 해석한 것이란 취지다.</p><!--EndFragment-->
